 Statements\nL308: \nL309: 【26†P202 - P264 - P280 - P305 + P351 + P338 - P308 + P313 - P337 + P313】\nL310: \nL311: ### Hazard Classifications\nL312: \nL313: Eye Irrit. 2 - Repr. 1B\nL314: ### Storage Class\nL315: \nL316: 6.1D - Non-combustible acute toxic Cat.3 / toxic hazardous materials or hazardous materials causing chronic effects\nL317: \nL318: ### WGK\nL319: \nL320: WGK 1\nL321: \nL322: ### Flash Point (°F)\nL323: \nL324: Not applicable\nL325: \nL326: ### Flash Point (°C)\nL327: \nL328: Not applicable\nL329: \nL330: * * *\nL331: \nL332: ## Documentation\nL333: \nL334: [Button: Certificate of Analysis][Button: Certificate of Origin]\nL335: \nL336: * * *\nL337: \nL338: Choose from one of the most recent versions:\nL339: ### Certificates of Analysis (COA)\nL340: \nL341: Lot/Batch Number\nL342: \nL343: It looks like we've run into a problem, but you can still download Certificates of Analysis from our 【27†Documents】 section.\nL344: \nL345: If you need assistance, please contact 【16†Customer Support】\nL346: ### Already Own This Product?\nL347: \nL348: Find documentation for the products that you have recently purchased in the Document Library.\nL349: \nL350: 【28†Visit the Document Library】\nL351: \nL352: * * *\nL353: \nL354: Related Categories\nL355: \nL356: 【5†Lab Chemicals】\nL357: \nL358: 【29†Salts】\nL359: \nL360: * * *\nL361: \nL362: ★★★★★ ★★★★★ 5 out of 5 stars. Read reviews for Sodium tetraborate decahydrate\nL363:     5.0\nL364:     【30†1 Review This action will navigate to reviews.】\nL365: \nL366: Search questions and answers ϙ [Input: Search questions and answers] Search questions and answers ✘ Clear Search field ϙ Search\nL367:   * 【30†1 Review】\nL368:   * 【30†2 Questions】\nL369:   * 【30†2 Answers】\nL370: ## Questions\nL371: \nL372: [Button: Ask a question ]\nL373: \nL374: 1–2 of 2 Questions\nL375: \nL376: Sort by: ▼ Menu\nL377: \nL378: [Select]\nL379: \nL380:   1. Anonymous\nL381: \nL382: · a year ago\nL383: ### How can I determine the shelf life / expiration / retest date of this product?\nL384: \nL385: 1 answer\nL386: \nL387:     1. Technical Support\nL388: \nL389: · a year ago\nL390: If this product has an expiration or retest date, it will be shown on the Certificate of Analysis (COA, CofA). If there is no retest or expiration date listed on the product's COA, we do not have suitable stability data to determine a shelf life. For these products, the only date on the COA will be the release date; a retest, expiration, or use-by-date will not be displayed.\nL391: For all products, we recommend handling per defined conditions as printed in our product literature and website product descriptions. We recommend that products should be routinely inspected by customers to ensure they perform as expected.\nL392: For products without retest or expiration dates, our standard warranty of 1 year from the date of shipment is applicable.\nL393: For more information, please refer to the Product Dating Information document: 【31†https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/deepweb/assets/sigmaaldrich/marketing/global/documents/418/501/product-dating-information-06-25-mk.pdf】\nL394: Helpful?\nL395: \nL396: Yes · 0 No · 0\nL397: \nL398: [Button: Report ]\nL399: \nL400:   2. Anonymous\nL401: \nL402: · 2 years ago\nL403: ### How is shipping temperature determined? And how is it related to the product storage temperature?\nL404: \nL405: 1 answer\nL406: \nL407:     1. Technical Support\nL408: \nL409: · 2 years ago\nL410: Products may be shipped at a different temperature than the recommended long-term storage temperature. If the product quality is sensitive to short-term exposure to conditions other than the recommended long-term storage, it will be shipped on wet or dry-ice. If the product quality is NOT affected by short-term exposure to conditions other than the recommended long-term storage, it will be shipped at ambient temperature.\nL411: As shipping routes are configured for minimum transit times, shipping at ambient temperature helps control shipping costs for our customers. For more information, please refer to the Storage and Transport Conditions document: 【32†https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/deepweb/assets/sigmaaldrich/marketing/global/documents/316/622/storage-transport-conditions-mk.pdf】\nL412: Helpful?\nL413: \nL414: Yes · 0 No · 0\nL415: \nL416: [Button: Report ]\nL417: ## Reviews\nL418: \nL419: Write a review . This action will open a modal dialog.\nL420: \nL421: ### Rating Snapshot\nL422: \nL423: Select a row below to filter reviews.\nL424: \nL425: 5★ stars\nL426: \nL427: 1 1 review with 5 stars. Select to filter reviews with 5 stars.\nL428: \nL429: 4★ stars\nL430: \nL431: 0 0 reviews with 4 stars. Select to filter reviews with 4 stars.\nL432: \nL433: 3★ stars\nL434: \nL435: 0 0 reviews with 3 stars. Select to filter reviews with 3 stars.\nL436: \nL437: 2★ stars\nL438: \nL439: 0 0 reviews with 2 stars. Select to filter reviews with 2 stars.\nL440: \nL441: 1★ stars\nL442: \nL443: 0 0 reviews with 1 star. Select to filter reviews with 1 star.\nL444: ### Average Customer Ratings\nL445: \nL446: Overall\nL447: \nL448: ★★★★★ ★★★★★ 5.0 Overall, average rating value is 5 of 5.\nL449: \nL450: ▼ Rating Filter by Rating\nL451: \nL452: Filter by Rating [Select]\nL453: \nL454: ▼ Locale Filter by Locale\nL455: \nL456: Filter by Locale [Select]\nL457: #### Active Filters\nL458:   * Active Filters 1 star Remove Filter  1 star ✘\nL459:   * Active Filters 2 stars Remove Filter  2 stars ✘\nL460:   * Active Filters 3 stars Remove Filter  3 stars ✘\nL461:   * Active Filters 4 stars Remove Filter  4 stars ✘\nL462:   * Active Filters 5 stars Remove Filter  5 stars ✘\nL463:   * Active Filters sq Remove Filter  sq ✘\nL464:   * Active Filters العربية Remove Filter  العربية ✘\nL465:   * Active Filters հայերեն Remove Filter  հայերեն ✘\nL466:   * Active Filters Euskara Remove Filter  Euskara ✘\nL467:   * Active Filters Беларуская мова Remove Filter  Беларуская мова ✘\nL468:   * Active Filters босански Remove Filter  босански ✘\n